  "title": "otel-optout-env-var",
  "request": "add an env var to turn off telemetry – the code always enables it, I'd like setting ENTIRE_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT to disable it",
  "edits": [
    {
      "path": "src/mcp/shared/_otel.py",
